t follows from (REF ) and (REF ) that {{formula:ed5d1c3d-49da-4fb3-89d4-17890e2f420b}}On account of these two inequalities, there holds {{formula:072a84b9-f656-4303-8e9c-8971395cd551}}and thus, it follows from equation () that {{formula:b2013808-fc9a-4a15-bb70-92dde49fdaed}}By Lemma REF , there is a subsequence, still indexed by {{formula:6f76898c-8fc1-4def-9cbd-b72b26765e54}} , such that {{formula:9c7ace64-7653-4175-a245-0511300b6c7a}}By (REF ) and (), there holds {{formula:6fe066c5-0f76-405e-8c20-030ba1704532}}By the aid of (REF ) and (REF ), it follows from () that {{formula:8986e7ea-5036-46ba-8f2e-8c01e3542326}}for any {{formula:0d2db982-a8ac-4f5f-acdf-cda989bd29ef}} and {{formula:ab6c2bf7-27ea-4cf0-bb4a-2bf2425cbfae}} with {{formula:0963383c-f122-4b4c-a72e-1bf537a4f918}} . Now, we can apply Lemma REF to deduce that {{formula:486ffb25-ea1b-42da-a125-605251e3752b}} in {{formula:457be3e4-00de-4816-a2b8-409b9a05b1df}} with {{formula:e8f488bf-2d74-488c-9e55-a7baf2da1cbc}} and {{formula:cea252c5-55ec-48f8-aa2d-e540b4c71d30}} and {{formula:7d25655d-dc19-465c-a450-64534a5a51a9}} . Hence, we can take the limit {{formula:483cb8fb-4425-4863-b5cd-19cdf2837db0}} to conclude that {{formula:d8d84369-7a5f-478f-84b1-91dc82cbb966}} is a weak solution to the system (REF )–() with the initial data {{formula:c93830cd-f7e0-45e9-b7ae-52c8a1d495b0}} . The proof is complete."}


