14-8c7a-4071-99a2-b53e3e0db583}} , such that {{formula:49f83274-9cbb-4162-86a0-ee28a7ae3f1e}} in {{formula:1417de9b-db78-4e33-a763-b20f9e636b1c}} . Since {{formula:49668837-d3fe-458c-af2e-5f55d6a3db1f}} , the compatible condition in Lemma REF holds true with {{formula:35bf5042-d887-490f-8e23-d43011da67f7}} . Let {{formula:943f4375-190e-4c32-b188-656293b2c04c}} be the constants stated in Lemma REF with {{formula:dfa2cb72-45ac-48a2-b567-7a5821ddb14a}} replaced by {{formula:76fe30f9-0fbf-4ed0-8b7c-c26e25be468a}} . Recalling that {{formula:55316924-f680-4442-b564-4e2d4f4aed94}} in {{formula:6fbebc5d-5f72-4900-90ca-514c923d2b47}} , then one can easily estimate {{formula:951ce456-735f-476e-94d1-037ad4c648d9}} .By Lemma REF and Lemma REF , there is a time {{formula:25f54e7b-1f55-4584-a0e6-00728c1cf279}} depending only on {{formula:c01bde21-dd6d-49f8-9675-a2e9a7b56e2e}} , {{formula:6b590560-6c1e-4c08-88fa-074a98ee8a50}} , {{formula:303b4e02-bbeb-4b31-9095-8c532a0b9301}} , {{formula:08a52965-c09b-4fc5-884a-37e66d2becd2}} , such that the system (REF )\u2013() has a unique strong solution {{formula:aee24830-fd34-4a53-9f48-bd0535366a3e}} in {{formula:0fd6b894-4021-430f-95bc-3fc10f72f8de}} , complemented with the initial data {{formula:fa7b26ac-20a8-4894-906e-244b820cfb9f}} and the boundary value data {{formula:bf39bda0-d0d4-42ef-b646-e92790f020b9}} , and there hold {{formula:ca4a73d0-3fc9-419d-8a9b-a78d65fe3303}}for {{formula:eeb71802-6b45-4033-a83a-2a0a115eb8c5}} . On account of this estimates, using diagonal argument, there is a subsequence, still indexed by {{formula:ccd40cd2-de5d-40a1-9ed4-14a03a3fe114}} , such that {{formula:3fe91db3-621c-4e12-8ce8-ab79adb8b357}}for any {{formula:80150224-24ca-4582-b4a0-e9ba073fff45}} , and the following inequality holds true {{formula:76b37970-174b-4257-830e-a9f10ffae10e}}By the Lemma REF , there holds {{formula:898e3109-ac10-48ea-909d-ced7f47b8b6c}}for any {{formula:b0353159-8e17-4fb5-93ae-c0cab376f958}} .On account of all the above conv