-e76e-4f50-8aea-88dcaea9cb2a}} is finite and we have {{formula:e0e9e7f5-a446-4922-896d-340837611805}} as {{formula:70035646-bd02-488e-ae40-4e31e3e51c35}} due to the fact that {{formula:98d91ef8-c274-4fc9-93e0-f7b34cb86343}} is bounded from the {{formula:6c94d86c-e806-4917-8dae-9c88ce23dd83}} conservation of solutions. In this case, the existence of another {{formula:53b5e451-a935-4cae-afb9-7f5a58f2fcdb}} such that {{formula:3a3a4b3a-c2a1-464b-a99a-9c7154beaec1}} follows from the continuity arguments. Blow-up. Now we want to show that by choosing suitable initial datum satisfying (REF ), the corresponding solution can indeed blow up in finite time. Recall from (REF ) that we have {{formula:12217284-9b9f-4aab-927f-c9fdabf3b7d5}} Note from (REF ) and (REF )–(REF ) that for {{formula:66bd4642-00ac-4b42-bb18-30d10dee25e6}} sufficiently small, {{formula:1f0cfe2f-e1fd-41a8-b3c0-2191405b6e0c}} satisfies the following Ricatti inequality {{formula:ef47e767-01bd-45aa-9a07-dd8bdc6824d8}} Therefore it follows from the routine analysis of the differential inequality (see, for example ) that if we choose initial datum satisfying {{formula:5683f370-7a25-4f53-b57f-bc4a966fc071}} then {{formula:018ea5ed-e45a-4594-946e-ba70340082df}} tends to {{formula:03fcd60b-f9ad-4606-a1ba-6cc5905985c9}} in finite time. To be more precise, let us pick the initial datum {{formula:e07f4538-62bd-4218-a5e7-82f1a90f2b86}} satisfying {{formula:76fc571b-1402-429f-9ba2-67e21d2c4d13}} with {{formula:304fa3fe-5534-4282-8170-53077e1d5b7c}} Then (REF ) is satisfied, and hence {{formula:a034d9a5-be64-4518-8126-fdb1c53ba46f}} as {{formula:5bd5d190-d57d-4864-bfd1-032cc7054bdb}} for some {{formula:12faf396-a091-46ec-99e3-50e637f5d623}} . Hence the maximal existence time {{formula:cdb56444-e7df-4193-a469-acbc04340d8d}} satisfies {{formula:e6cb89ea-cb2e-44bc-8b04-f97032b5bd85}} . Acknowledgments: The work of RMC is partially supported by National Science Foundation under grant DMS-1613375 and DMS-1907584. The work of DEP is partially supported by the NSERC Discovery grant."}

